    {
      "number": "871",
      "text": "871. \u5316\u7b80\uff1a\na) $(\\sqrt{21}+\\sqrt{14}-2\\sqrt{35})\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}+\\sqrt{20}$\uff1b\nb) $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{15})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3})+\\sqrt{75}$.",
